				\begin{document}$$ {\text{SDSMRN}} = \frac{{{\text{SMRN}}}}{{{\text{Total}}\;{\text{reads}}}} \times \;20\;{\text{million}}{.} $$\end{document}SDSMRN=SMRNTotalreads×20million.
